    "summary": "Portrait of a young woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young woman stands on her elbows with her torso upside down and her legs bent to the right. She wears a purple skirt, a red short-sleeved jacket, and a green blouse. Three fruits are placed on the yellow and white carpet near her. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
